msgstr "**Title** - the title of the option that will be displayed in the journal."

#: ../../settings_kb/Aspects.rst:364
msgid ""
"**Camel DSL** - Camel DSL с типом IMPORT_DATA, в котором описана "
"обработка данных."
msgstr ""
"**Camel DSL** - Camel DSL with type IMPORT_DATA, which describes data "
"processing."

#: ../../settings_kb/Aspects.rst:365
